# Astro / build artefacts
dist/
.astro/
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Auto-generated docs (`cmd/ferndoc` emits these; the docs workflow
# regenerates them before each build). Committing them would put
# generated content under review with no source-of-truth and double the
# diff size on every stdlib change.
src/content/docs/stdlib/*.md
!src/content/docs/stdlib/index.md

# Embedded playground bundle (copied in from web/ at build time;
# committing it would duplicate web/fern.wasm under version control).
public/playground/
